---
title: RuntimeService · process
---
stateDiagram-v2
    direction TB
    [*] --> starting : Spawn
    starting --> serving : TakeLock, Bind
    starting --> dead : LoseRace [lock held]
    serving --> draining : Retire [other build]
    serving --> dead : IdleExit [nothing queued]
    draining --> dead : ExitDrained [no attempt]
    starting --> dead : Crash
    serving --> dead : Crash
    draining --> dead : Crash
    dead --> [*]
    note right of serving
        INV LockedOwner: a live process
        holds service.lock.
        INV OneOwner: at most one.
    end note
    note right of dead
        Crash frees the lock and lease,
        drops memory and unread frames.
        Intent records stay on disk;
        started work may still complete.
    end note
    class starting wait
    class serving live
    class draining wait
    class dead idle
